WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.225
Module 3 is device and user certificates.

2
00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:05.568
Intune puts certificates on devices,

3
00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:09.650
and Entra ID decides whether a
certificate proves who someone is.

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.444
Those are two jobs that fail
differently: one fails visibly,

5
00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:16.920
the other can quietly let
the wrong certificate pass.
